        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"d68e3c4e-22c8-485c-93a3-862072e1ead5\",\"review_text\":\"Tolong bgt dong di fix server buat pembelian premium nya, saya hdh dr lama bgt gapernah bisa beli premium, setiap masuk sesi pembayaran lsg disconnected dan gapernah bisa connect, klo gini terus lama\\\" aku pake Spotify mod aja drpd orinya klo ky gini\"},{\"review_id\":\"aeb9b1c7-8b69-4f69-a3d0-4ae3afdcd16f\",\"review_text\":\"The best app ever in music the sound quality of music is just amazing literally don't have words to explain plz try this once a moment only have one problem that's the amount of subscription for premium is high so please...... by the way left all the things are best....\"},{\"review_id\":\"cc1337b0-4765-4998-a4c8-56e06dfbb90c\",\"review_text\":\"Excellent interface and easy to use\"},{\"review_id\":\"f3689bf3-b632-4797-bdbf-898eb097bc7a\",\"review_text\":\"They ask every thing prime\"},{\"review_id\":\"e89c6d6b-c2cb-4ec1-b528-fcf5e600a148\",\"review_text\":\"It's just the best.\"},{\"review_id\":\"2c1b2db1-37a3-4390-91a8-9925989dd6ef\",\"review_text\":\"I can always find my music the one that helps me relax I just love Spotify♥️\"},{\"review_id\":\"e2c1010b-c147-4511-82fb-58e23740971c\",\"review_text\":\"Tooo much bad 😡\"},{\"review_id\":\"27907435-abca-4b35-b545-6204d0622949\",\"review_text\":\"Everything is perfect except way too many ads\"},{\"review_id\":\"3981ecae-4123-4341-90a6-231e32d2ef03\",\"review_text\":\"💓\"},{\"review_id\":\"2ef16d48-e0b5-498d-a8d8-8f8ee7553be7\",\"review_text\":\"The only streaming app where you can't fast forward or rewind. The most basic thing ever for a streaming app. Shocking\"}]}"
